hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2810","Narrated to us Yunus bin Abd al-A'la, who informed us that Ibn Wahb informed him, who said: Malik informed me from Ibn Shihab, from Salim bin Abdullah, that Abdullah bin Umar came to Al-Hajjaj bin Yusuf on the Day of Arafah when the sun had passed its zenith, and I was with him. Abdullah bin Umar said: \"Depart (for the plain of Arafah) if you intend to follow the Sunnah.\" Al-Hajjaj asked: \"At this hour?\" He replied: \""
